A directory argument is walked recursively by the mask, and the entries are emitted in sorted path
order — the seeding order below is zeta, alpha, mid, so an unsorted walk would show it.

The artifacts carry an empty `sessions:` list on purpose: this case is about discovery order only,
so every metric is the zero of its type and nothing has to be derived from a transcript.

-- fixtures/cwd/vault/zeta/index.md --
---
sessions: []
---

Body.
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/alpha/index.md --
---
sessions: []
---

Body.
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/mid/index.md --
---
sessions: []
---

Body.
-- cmd --
booping session-stats vault --dry-run
-- exit --
0
